      },
      "sha256": "9181921d4a1e05c3a62083c6243b1fdc8ab65446b6eabc52d2f73aaea1fd9394",
      "text": "- When working inside a worktree, write every path you show me relative to the main checkout, not the worktree root \u2014 prefix it with the worktree's own directory (e.g. `.worktrees/<name>/\u2026`). I am standing in the main checkout, where a worktree-relative path does not resolve. Inside a worktree the real path is in the host's storage (git and `pwd -P` show it); still write `.worktrees/<name>/\u2026`, by convention, not by reading the cwd.\n"
    }
